@page "/login"
@layout EmptyLayout

<PageTitle>Entrar — Gates of Hell</PageTitle>

<div class="login-screen">
    <section class="login-hero">
        <div class="login-hero__glow"></div>

        <svg class="gate" viewBox="0 0 720 900" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <defs>
                <linearGradient id="gateStroke" x1="360" y1="180" x2="360" y2="900" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                    <stop stop-color="#d3ad68" stop-opacity=".8" />
                    <stop offset=".55" stop-color="#e2542c" stop-opacity=".45" />
                    <stop offset="1" stop-color="#e2542c" stop-opacity="0" />
                </linearGradient>
                <radialGradient id="gateGlow" cx="0" cy="0" r="1" gradientTransform="translate(360 430) rotate(90) scale(330 270)" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                    <stop stop-color="#e2542c" stop-opacity=".26" />
                    <stop offset="1" stop-color="#e2542c" stop-opacity="0" />
                </radialGradient>
                <filter id="gateBlur" x="-40%" y="-40%" width="180%" height="180%">
                    <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="26" />
                </filter>
            </defs>

            <ellipse cx="360" cy="430" rx="270" ry="330" fill="url(#gateGlow)" filter="url(#gateBlur)" />
            <path d="M138 860V430a222 222 0 0 1 444 0v430" stroke="url(#gateStroke)" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <path d="M178 860V436a182 182 0 0 1 364 0v424" stroke="url(#gateStroke)" stroke-width="1" opacity=".6" />
            <path d="M360 214v646M222 348v512M498 348v512M138 560h444M178 700h364" stroke="url(#gateStroke)" stroke-width=".8" opacity=".45" />
            <path d="M282 860V450a78 78 0 0 1 156 0v410" stroke="url(#gateStroke)" stroke-width="1.2" opacity=".75" />
            <circle cx="360" cy="430" r="8" fill="#d3ad68" opacity=".8" />
            <circle cx="360" cy="430" r="24" stroke="#e2542c" stroke-opacity=".35" />
            <path d="M90 868h540M60 884h600" stroke="#d3ad68" stroke-opacity=".18" />
        </svg>

        <div class="login-hero__content">
            <div class="login-brand">
                <span class="brand__mark"><Icon Name="flame" Size="20" /></span>
                <span>Gates of Hell</span>
                <span class="login-brand__rule"></span>
                <span class="login-brand__tag">RPG</span>
            </div>

            <div class="login-hero__main">
                <span class="eyebrow">Crônicas da mesa</span>
                <h1>As fichas pesam<br />mais que a <em>alma.</em></h1>
                <p>
                    Um lugar para a sua ficha viver: atributos, perícias, inventário e cada
                    dado que a mesa rolar. O mestre vê tudo acontecer — e a planilha nunca esquece.
                </p>

                <ul class="login-features">
                    <li>
                        <span class="login-features__num">01</span>
                        <span>
                            <strong>Ficha completa</strong>
                            <span>Status, atributos e o orçamento de perícias da classe.</span>
                        </span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="login-features__num">02</span>
                        <span>
                            <strong>Rolagens Rollem</strong>
                            <span>Mesma sintaxe do bot: d20, explosões, keep/drop e inline.</span>
                        </span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="login-features__num">03</span>
                        <span>
                            <strong>Mesa viva</strong>
                            <span>Itens e mudanças do mestre aparecem sem recarregar.</span>
                        </span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="login-hero__foot">
                <span>Google Sheets + Apps Script</span>
                <span class="dot-sep">·</span>
                <span>Dados por Rollem V1</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="login-form-side">
        <LoginPanel MasterMode="false" RedirectTo="ficha" />
        <p class="login-master-note">
            Está conduzindo a mesa? O painel do mestre roda em um app separado.
        </p>
    </section>
</div>
